Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.50,0:00:29.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,照{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}ILLUMINA…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.52,0:00:32.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,照民{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}ILLUMINATIO…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.55,0:00:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,照名{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}ILLUMINATIA…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.57,0:00:36.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,干嘛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.55,0:00:42.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,照明电影{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}ILLUMINATION!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.54,0:00:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,在1985年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The year was 1985,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.51,0:00:59.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,电视上首屈一指的节目是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the number-one show on television was…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.55,0:01:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,布拉特小恶魔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evil Bratt.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.51,0:01:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,本节目由巴尔萨泽·布拉特领衔出演少年天才{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The show starred young Balthazar Bratt as a child prodigy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.51,0:01:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是犯罪天才 决心称霸世界{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and criminal mastermind… bent on world domination.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.58,0:01:12.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在那 抓住他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There he is! Get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.59,0:01:18.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可是个坏小子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been a bad boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.59,0:01:21.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,布拉特是80年代最出名的童星{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bratt was the biggest child actor of the 1980s,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.50,0:01:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,打动了全球观众的心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}striking a chord with audiences all over the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.58,0:01:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在那 抓住他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There he is! Get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.51,0:01:31.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,但一切都在第三季结束了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it all came to an end in season three,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.59,0:01:32.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.59,0:01:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有没有很坏坏啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been a bad boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.55,0:01:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位年轻的明星经历了意想不到的青春发育期{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The young star experienced an unexpected growth spurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.53,0:01:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,节目被取消了 好莱坞将他拒之门外{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The show was canceled. Hollywood rejected him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.51,0:01:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,布拉特的生活迅速直线下滑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Bratt quickly plunged into a downward spiral.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.55,0:01:50.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他开始相信自己就是电视里的那个角色{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Starting to actually believed he was the character he played on TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.58,0:01:52.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you looking at?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.57,0:01:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们不禁好奇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leading us all to wonder…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.56,0:01:56.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他现在在哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he now?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.53,0:02:04.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what, Clive?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.56,0:02:07.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,在电视上扮演恶人很有趣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Playing a villain on TV was fun,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.51,0:02:10.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现实生活中作恶会更爽{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but being one in real life is even better.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.56,0:02:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,盗窃音乐响起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heist music!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.50,0:02:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here it comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.56,0:02:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,干嘛 克莱夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Clive!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.58,0:02:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要干嘛 这怎么是盗窃音乐呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing? How is that heist music?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.56,0:02:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我的锅{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, my bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.59,0:03:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.53,0:03:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我停{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop right…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.52,0:03:11.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 船上混入了某个 怪物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, the ship has been boarded by some kind of… monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.57,0:03:13.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,等下 那不是怪物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, that's not a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.56,0:03:16.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只是个穿了垫肩的男人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a man wearing shoulder pads.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.55,0:03:20.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一位超级大坏蛋的衣品会那么老气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's only one supervillain whose fashion sense is quite that dated,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.54,0:03:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴尔萨泽·布拉特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Balthazar Bratt.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.54,0:03:25.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟糕 杜邦钻石还在那船上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blast it! The Dupont Diamond is on that ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.51,0:03:29.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,派所有附近的特工立刻出发去现场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want every agent in the area on the scene immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.55,0:03:37.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经到了 格鲁西特工马上就到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're already here! Agents Grucy are closing in fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.54,0:03:40.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 什么 你叫我们什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes… wait, wha? What did you call us?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.51,0:03:42.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,格鲁西 格鲁加露西变成格鲁西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grucy. You know, Gru and Lucy mushed together.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.59,0:03:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫叫看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.50,0:03:46.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢 但不太喜欢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Haha! I like it, but not a lot,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.55,0:03:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.59,0:03:53.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.59,0:03:55.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.52,0:04:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护钻石 快行动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The jewel! Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.50,0:04:19.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.53,0:04:21.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.50,0:04:38.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又来晚了 格鲁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too late again, Gru. Ha, ha, ha…!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.54,0:04:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}WHAAA…?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.56,0:04:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要逃走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's getting away!!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.56,0:04:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想得美{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what he thinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.54,0:04:57.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,出发{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.57,0:04:59.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,快行动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ugh! Go, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.55,0:05:01.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.54,0:05:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该抓不到了 格鲁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think we can make it, Gru.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.53,0:05:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can make it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.57,0:05:14.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can make it…!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.53,0:05:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.55,0:05:19.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.52,0:05:24.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好迎接 什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get ready for whaaa…!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.59,0:05:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. How're you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.57,0:05:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.50,0:05:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.50,0:05:42.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们真可爱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys are so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.50,0:05:44.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,去抓他 小鲁鲁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go get him, Gru Gru!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.52,0:05:47.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊 格鲁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Gru.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.58,0:05:49.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你适应得如何呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's your transition coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.53,0:05:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,从世界级大恶棍变成世界最烂特工{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, from world's worst villain to world's worst agent?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.50,0:05:55.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,太搞笑了 你应该上电视{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that's hilarious! You should be on TV!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.54,0:05:57.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦对了 你之前有节目{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that's right, you were…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.55,0:05:59.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果节目被取消了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but then you got canceled.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.57,0:06:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.52,0:06:05.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 姑娘们干的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whaaa… Oh! Girls?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.55,0:06:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如跳舞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dance fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.50,0:06:30.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,A队 钻石很安全{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alpha team, the diamond is secure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.53,0:06:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来带走它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come and pick up the package.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.50,0:06:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到 A队已经出发{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy that, Alpha team on approach.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.59,0:06:41.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,格鲁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gru.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.53,0:06:43.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真以为我失去意识了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you actually think I was unconscious?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.57,0:06:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我的演技 哥们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's called acting, hoser!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.58,0:06:48.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然我技艺还未生疏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And clearly I've still got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.52,0:07:07.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可是个坏小子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been a baaaad boy! Ha, ha, ha, ha, ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.56,0:07:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freeze! Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.58,0:07:10.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是见了录像带的鬼了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a Betamax!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.52,0:07:11.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,快行动 抓住他 快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go! Get him! Get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.57,0:07:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要跑了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's getting away!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.56,0:07:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事没完 听到了吗 格鲁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't over, Gru! You hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.51,0:07:19.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你没完{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not over!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.51,0:07:22.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,那又如何 钻石在我手上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? Well, I still have the diamond!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.56,0:07:28.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你生日快乐 祝你生日快乐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happy birthday to you. Happy birthday to…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.54,0:07:33.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝丹生日快乐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happy birthday, dear Daaaan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.59,0:07:38.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你生日快乐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happy birthday to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.56,0:07:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 准备好了吗 - 是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, you ready? - Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.59,0:07:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,派对开始了 大家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Party! Party, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.50,0:08:02.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Watch it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.59,0:08:11.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不敢相信又一次放跑了布拉特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe Bratt got away, again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.50,0:08:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这怎么可能 怎么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is this possible? How…?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.51,0:08:25.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不仅仅是他跑了让我生气 还有他那股自以为是的劲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's not just that he got away! It's that he's so smug about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.50,0:08:29.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,真恶心 我可是个坏小子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ewww. I've been a baaaad boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.56,0:08:31.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊 埃德娜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Edna, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.52,0:08:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天挺 美的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looking hot… today.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.50,0:08:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,身上爬了 那么多只猫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got the… cats on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.50,0:08:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且今天真羞耻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it was just so humiliating.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.52,0:08:40.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿着泡泡糖做的泳衣被吊在那{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dangling there in the bubble-gum Speedo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.54,0:08:42.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这周都没时间去健身房{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I didn't have time to go to the gym this week!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.58,0:08:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,早饭还吃了好多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I had a big breakfast!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.54,0:08:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感觉有点水肿了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was feeling a little bloated!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.59,0:08:52.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他都不值得费心讨论{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? He's not even worth talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.51,0:08:56.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都不想为他再浪费一点口舌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't even want to waste another breath about the guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.56,0:08:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And another thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.51,0:09:03.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,下次再见到布拉特 我要在他脸上月球漫步{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next time I see Bratt, I will moonwalk all over his stupid face!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.57,0:09:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢你们临时过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you all for coming in such short notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.55,0:09:16.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,很遗憾通知你今天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is with great sadness that I inform you that as of today.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.56,0:09:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要退休不再担任反恶盟的领导{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am retiring as head of the AVL.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.54,0:09:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,别啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh no…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.58,0:09:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的新上司是从总部直接派来的 立即生效{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your new leader is coming directly from head office, effective immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.57,0:09:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,她就是很有天赋 野心的瓦莱丽·达芬奇小姐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is the very gifted, very ambitious Miss Valerie Da Vinci.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.56,0:09:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,扫过你们一个个的面孔 无数回忆涌上心头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As I look out over all of your faces, I am flooded with so many memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.57,0:09:48.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 见鬼 今天真适合打瞌睡 - 我 打扰一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh boy, this is a snoozeday. - I… Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.59,0:09:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们明白了 你又老又肥 说完了吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blah blah blah. We understand. You're old, you're fat, you're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.53,0:09:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我喘口气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me breathe in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.55,0:09:58.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,出了点汗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Woo. Broke a little sweat there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.56,0:10:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,新官上任三把火{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}First order of business.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.50,0:10:05.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们哪个废柴是格鲁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which one of you losers is Agent Gru?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.51,0:10:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是在说我了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh? that would be me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.54,0:10:12.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我不认为废柴这个词很恰当{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Although I don't know if I'd say 'loser' per Se,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.58,0:10:14.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}kind of a… Huh!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.53,0:10:19.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,女儿们来电话了 真不是时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it's the girls. Not a good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.54,0:10:24.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 长官 女长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir. Huh, uh… ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.54,0:10:25.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让我都紧张了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're making me nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.57,0:10:28.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么能让巴尔萨泽·布拉特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could you let Balthazar Bratt,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.58,0:10:32.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,反恶盟头号恶人逃走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the AVL's most-wanted villain, just get away?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.55,0:10:34.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,和我们的职责背道而驰啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is the opposite of what we do here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.58,0:10:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 也许他又是逃走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay, yes, maybe he got away… again,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.50,0:10:41.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他没拿到钻石{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he didn't get the diamond!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.58,0:10:44.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我差一点就能抓到他了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I am this close to bringing him in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.59,0:10:47.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这么一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This close!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.51,0:10:48.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,有意思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh? Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.59,0:10:50.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被辞退了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're fired!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.53,0:10:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.55,0:10:54.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这太不公平了 格鲁是优秀的特工{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is totally not fair. Gru is a great agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.54,0:10:55.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要是炒了他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? If you fire him,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.58,0:10:58.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,就得炒掉我 姐妹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're going to have to fire me, sister sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.52,0:11:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的要这么做吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And do you really want to do that? Do ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.59,0:11:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 别这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.51,0:11:11.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来她很有种{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I guess she did!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.54,0:11:19.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 你没必要陪我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, you didn't have to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.52,0:11:20.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你多爱这份工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know how much you love your job.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.50,0:11:24.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我更爱别的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I love other things more.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.51,0:11:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得把这消息告诉女儿们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, we're going to have to tell the girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.55,0:11:30.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能办到吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.53,0:11:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还没完全适应当妈这件事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole Mom thing is still kind of new to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.52,0:11:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.58,0:11:51.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.54,0:12:03.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们好 - 你们好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Aloha! - Aloha!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.57,0:12:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是意想不到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is unexpected.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.51,0:12:10.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们一直都没机会去度蜜月{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you never got to go on a honeymoon, so?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.59,0:12:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们给们你准备了了晚餐 - 是夏威夷式烤野猪宴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We made you dinner - It's a luau!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.51,0:12:15.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有椰子菠萝还有尤克里里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got pineapples and coconuts and lukuleles!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.59,0:12:18.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真好 - 太好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh ho, yeah. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.54,0:12:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士先生 这是今日例汤{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The soup of the day, madame and monsieur.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.51,0:12:38.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,小熊糖是我的主意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gummy bears were my idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.55,0:12:45.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好看了都不舍得下嘴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mmm? Looks too good to even eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.59,0:12:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.50,0:12:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这是为你做的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I made it for you.ah?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.54,0:13:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,好汤 我真喜欢肉与小熊糖的组合{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good soup! I love the combination of gummy bears and meat!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.52,0:13:08.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会含在嘴里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna hold it in my mouth,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.59,0:13:10.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为太好吃了我都不舍得吞下去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}because it's so good I don't want to swallow it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.59,0:13:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,工作顺心吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So… how was work?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.57,0:13:16.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打败那个人了吗 发生爆炸了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you take that guy down? Did anything explode?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.51,0:13:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实 今天我和露西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, actually, today Lucy and I…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.58,0:13:25.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,被邀请不用再去反恶盟了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…were invited to not work at the AVL anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.51,0:13:28.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.50,0:13:31.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被开除了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got fired?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.51,0:13:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是这样的 不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh no! No, no, no…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.52,0:13:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.57,0:13:38.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,但别担心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But don't worry,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.57,0:13:41.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们很快就会找到工作的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure we'll get new jobs real soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.54,0:13:43.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,找更好工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even better ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.57,0:13:47.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有什么比当超酷的秘密特工更好的工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's better than being super-cool secret agents?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.50,0:13:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道了 我们可以在线赌博{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I know! You could gamble online!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.56,0:13:52.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯蒂的爸爸就干那个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what Katie's dad does!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.57,0:13:55.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们绝对要仔细考虑一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, we will definitely look into that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.55,0:13:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这建议不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a good suggestion.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.54,0:14:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们以后别去凯蒂家了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And let's not go over to Katie's house anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.50,0:14:07.53,Note,0,0,0,0,,（梅尔 来电）
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.50,0:14:10.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家 安静 你应该没听懂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, sssshh! I don't think you heard me right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.56,0:14:14.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 不是的 这不意味着我们要变回坏人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no, no, this does not mean that we are going back to being villains.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.51,0:14:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,无聊 你以前不是这样的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boring! You weren't like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.56,0:14:19.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我明白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, alright, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.57,0:14:22.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我知道最近并不好过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I know it's been a little tough lately,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.53,0:14:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其是尼法里奥博士意外把自己封在了碳素里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}especially with Doctor Nefario accidentally freezing himself in carbonite,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.58,0:14:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们的犯罪生涯结束了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But our life of crime is over!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.55,0:14:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅尔 梅尔 你支持我 对吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mel. Mel, you're with me on this, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.54,0:14:40.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.57,0:14:42.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很好 - 耶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good… - Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.54,0:14:44.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,无聊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boring!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.54,0:14:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很好 - 耶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good… - Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.51,0:14:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,无聊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boring!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.52,0:14:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 赞 - 耶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good… - Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.51,0:14:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,无聊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boring!!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.58,0:14:55.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不要无聊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}no more boring!!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.54,0:14:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,无聊 无聊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boring! Boring!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.58,0:15:00.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家 听我说 读我口型{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys! Listen to me and read my lips!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.58,0:15:05.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,读我口型 我们不再犯傻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lissa me lippo, pomodoro la comquit!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.55,0:15:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Ohh…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.53,0:15:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说的是什么 犯傻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did I say? "la comquit?"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.53,0:15:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们不再犯罪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, okay, pomodoro la kumquat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.53,0:15:17.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说不再犯罪了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, whoa, whoa. Did you say no more crime?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.56,0:15:18.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能接受{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot accept this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.55,0:15:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许你那么和我说话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't take that tone with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.51,0:15:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不会再做坏人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not going back to villainy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.51,0:15:23.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不再干坏事了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh. No villainy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.55,0:15:27.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 以后再也不要在我面前说起这件事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. And I don't want to hear another word about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.54,0:15:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我警告你们如果再不住嘴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, if you guys don't stop that right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.51,0:15:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就给你们好看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}there will be consequences!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.50,0:15:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想做什么就做什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can do whatever I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.55,0:15:39.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,说话注意点儿 不然你会后悔的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't say anything you're going to regret.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.57,0:15:42.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你给我听好了 我不干了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Listen to this. I quit!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.58,0:15:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.53,0:15:46.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 你要走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? You quit?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.58,0:15:49.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是认真的吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're serious? Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.53,0:15:54.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bud-Buddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.56,0:15:56.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴夫 杰瑞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dave! Jerry!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.57,0:16:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有一个好消息 你们现在升职了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great news, guys… you've been promoted.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.50,0:16:04.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们以后就是头儿了 不错吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're in charge now, eh? Not bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.59,0:16:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,好耶 好耶 好耶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yipa! Yipo! Yippee!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.58,0:16:12.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,万岁 万岁 万岁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aruba-ruba-ruba-ruba!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.50,0:16:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jeesh!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.59,0:16:23.50,Note,0,0,0,0,,（巴黎 法国）
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.51,0:16:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,胖波先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monsieur Pompo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.57,0:16:42.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,请问全世界最有名的珠宝专家为什么会突然大驾光临呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To what do we owe the presence of the world's foremost gem expert?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.53,0:16:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是警察局长派我来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The chief of police sent me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.53,0:16:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为最近有人想要抢劫杜邦钻石 所以他担心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was concerned that during the recent heist attempt,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.52,0:16:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,钻石有可能已经被人偷梁换柱了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Dupont Diamond was replaced with a phony.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.53,0:17:09.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 真不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh la la.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.58,0:17:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们全都被骗了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have been duped.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.56,0:17:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 被骗了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? We have?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.51,0:17:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.53,0:17:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,被我骗的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}By me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.57,0:17:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wha-What is…?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.59,0:17:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 救命呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh no. Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.51,0:17:34.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈 哈 哈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha ha ha…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.53,0:17:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可是个坏小子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been a bad boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.52,0:17:52.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我该用法语说 我可是个坏小子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or should I say, "Je suis un mauvais garmanon!"
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.56,0:18:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.59,0:18:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,格鲁 你在这儿干什么呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Gru, whatcha doing down here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.50,0:18:35.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑黑的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.58,0:18:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.57,0:18:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么 想点儿事儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh nothing, just thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.55,0:18:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.50,0:18:43.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 没事 对 我没事 我好着呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh yes, yeah, I'm fine, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.57,0:18:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.59,0:18:51.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 我觉得我就是个失败者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I guess I just feel like a failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.57,0:18:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,就好像找不到人生目标了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I don't have a purpose anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.50,0:18:57.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 亲爱的 你才不是失败者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, mister, you are not a failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.56,0:19:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要是能抓住布拉特就好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If only I could've nailed Bratt.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.51,0:19:04.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么多次我差点儿就抓住他了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So many times I almost had him!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.55,0:19:07.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,但以后再也不会有机会了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now I'll never get the chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.51,0:19:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我已经被联盟给开除了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause I have been kicked to the curb.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.52,0:19:12.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,格鲁 你要放下这件事 你该振作起来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gru, you've got to let this go. It's time to look forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.59,0:19:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情总会好起来的 我保证{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things will get better, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.56,0:19:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我走 跟我走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow me. Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.51,0:19:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,过一过了 让路了啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coming through, make way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.52,0:19:38.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 过一下了 - 哦 不好意思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Coming through. - Uh, excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.52,0:19:42.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,打扰一下 年轻 人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pardon me, young… people.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.58,0:19:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想问一下到这个地方怎么走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you tell me how to get to this address?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.50,0:19:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是在小黄人儿吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are looking for Minions?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.55,0:19:51.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要找的是格鲁先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm looking for a Mr. Gru.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.59,0:19:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,格鲁就是个糟糕的老板{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gru is a lousy boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.56,0:19:56.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就是 - 就是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah! - Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.56,0:19:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,再会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.58,0:20:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,笨蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Idiots.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.58,0:20:11.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 凯尔 停下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Kyle. Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.50,0:20:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯尔 住嘴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kyle, let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.57,0:20:17.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,布拉特偷了世界上最大的钻石{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}BRATT STEALS WORLD'S BIGGEST DIAMOND.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.57,0:20:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 开什么国际玩笑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no… you've got to be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.59,0:20:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,露西 你有没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucy, did you see…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.50,0:20:25.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,做了噩梦的话他能安慰你 而且抱着他真的感觉很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He helps you if you have nightmares, and he's really good to snuggle with…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.59,0:20:27.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 不不 艾格尼丝 艾格尼丝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh no, no, no, Agnes! Agnes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.57,0:20:29.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 请照顾好他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, take good care of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.59,0:20:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.56,0:20:34.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾格尼丝 你在干什么呀 你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agnes, what are you doing? You…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.53,0:20:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你卖了你的独角兽{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sold your unicorn?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.51,0:20:40.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,是呀 我只想帮帮你 你现在都没有工作了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I just wanted to help. Since you don't have a job.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.57,0:20:43.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我卖了整整两美元哦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got two whole dollars for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.50,0:20:47.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,额 打扰一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.58,0:20:49.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 我们不卖了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, buddy, the sale's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.59,0:20:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 但是我只耽误您一两{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, but this will only take a…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.56,0:20:53.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 老家伙 快给我走开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Eyebrows. Get off the lawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.59,0:20:55.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 但是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.53,0:20:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 能不能 - 哦 额 没问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, could you… - Oh uh, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.57,0:21:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 我要说了 我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, as I was saying. I…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.51,0:21:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 额 哦 - 再见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Uh… Oh. - Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.52,0:21:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 艾格尼丝 你根本用不着担心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, Agnes. You don't need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.56,0:21:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不会有事的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going to be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.54,0:21:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的吗 - 真的呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- For real? - For real.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.57,0:21:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来吧 我们把东西收拾一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now come on, let's pack this stuff up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.57,0:21:22.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是吧 哥们 你是没弄白我的意思吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously? Buddy, you're not getting the hint.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.55,0:21:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 格鲁先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, Mr. Gru.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.52,0:21:28.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我真的有件事需要跟你谈一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I really must have a word with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.56,0:21:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道我的名字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you know my name?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.52,0:21:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,请允许我介绍一下我自己 我的名字叫弗里茨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Allow me to introduce myself… my name is Fritz!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.54,0:21:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,好狗狗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, good puppy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.59,0:21:41.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我今天过来见你 是因为你的孪生兄弟德鲁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I am inquiring on behalf of your twin brother, Dru.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.56,0:21:43.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他需要您的帮助{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He needs your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.52,0:21:44.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 孪生兄弟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Twin brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.59,0:21:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,孪生兄弟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twin brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.50,0:21:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,孪生兄弟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twin brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.51,0:21:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.51,0:21:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他希望您能乘飞机去逍遥国见他一面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He would like to fly you to Freedonia to meet him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.56,0:21:55.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们兄弟两个的父亲最近过世了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father has recently passed away and…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.55,0:21:58.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 疯老头 不好意思 小的时候我爸爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, cuckoo. I'm sorry, but my dad died.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.54,0:22:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,就死掉了 而且我也没什么兄弟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}when I was a baby, and I don't have any brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.50,0:22:02.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定是找错人了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got the wrong guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.54,0:22:03.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.56,0:22:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 您又怎么解释 这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then how do you explain… this?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.58,0:22:16.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊哈哈 太棒了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ahhhhh! Bellissimo!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.58,0:22:21.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦 你好 格鲁 - 你好 妈妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, hello, Gru. - Hi, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.59,0:22:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在风华正茂的时候 一定要保持足够的运动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's important to keep active in one's golden years.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.52,0:22:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这里呀 我的小可爱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you are, you cute cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.52,0:22:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这两个小伙子是我的潜水教练 文森佐和保罗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are my diving instructors, Vincenzo and Paolo!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.53,0:22:42.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 帅哥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ciao, boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.56,0:22:44.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 你找我有事吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.58,0:22:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 我是不是有个孪生兄弟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom, do I have a twin brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.58,0:22:50.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么知道的 是谁告诉的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you find out? Who told you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.58,0:22:52.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢着 什么 是真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, what? It's true?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.53,0:22:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从来也没说过我还有个兄弟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never told me I had a brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.54,0:22:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还说我出生时我老爸失望透顶 所以死掉了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you told me that Dad died of disappointment when I was born!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.50,0:23:01.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 对 这是我和你爸爸的约定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah, that was the agreement.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.55,0:23:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,约定 你到底在说什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agreement? What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.54,0:23:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们兄弟两个出生后还没多久 我和你爸爸就离婚了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shortly after you and your brother were born, your father and I divorced.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.50,0:23:16.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们俩说好了一个人带一个儿子抚养{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We each took one son to raise on our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.53,0:23:20.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且约定这辈子不要再见面了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And promised never to see each other again.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.53,0:23:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,很显然 我只能要他选剩下的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obviously, I got second pick.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.52,0:23:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有一个兄弟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.52,0:23:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,姑娘们 坐在前排的的感觉怎么样呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey girls, how are things in row B, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.51,0:23:42.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还特地安排了一些有趣的活动哦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've put together some fun activities for the trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.56,0:23:45.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁想跟我玩一把炸金花呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is up for some Gin Rummy?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.56,0:23:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 额 还是算了吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Umm… We're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.55,0:23:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.54,0:23:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就坐在后面玩接龙的吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll just sit here and play solitaire.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.51,0:23:55.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望我能赢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope I win.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.54,0:23:58.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道德鲁长什么样子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wonder what Dru will be like!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.50,0:24:00.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们两个不是双胞胎吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we'll have that twin thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.58,0:24:03.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,没准我们我们会有心灵感应的 你知道吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}where we can read each other's minds, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.59,0:24:07.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要是有就太酷了 - 哦 超级酷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How cool would that be?! - Um, super cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.58,0:24:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,逍遥国呀 逍遥国呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freedonia! Freedonia!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.55,0:24:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 小猪 小猪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, piggy, piggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.58,0:24:34.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,娃 看那座房子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa! Look at that house!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.58,0:24:36.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像一座城堡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like a castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.55,0:24:40.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我等不及要见我的兄弟了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't wait to meet my brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.56,0:24:42.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些猪是怎么回事儿呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's with all the pigs?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.58,0:24:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个是你们的家族产业{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the family business.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.51,0:24:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是整个逍遥国里最大规模的养猪场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The largest pig farm in the whole of Freedonia.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.55,0:24:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 好猪猪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, nice pig.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.52,0:24:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这可是我的隐私部位{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! That's my private part!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.54,0:24:59.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这头猪是个暴脾气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This pig has issues!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.53,0:25:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 请进{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.58,0:25:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 这真是太棒了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, this is amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.58,0:25:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像是西斯廷教堂 但画的都是猪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, it's like the Sistine Chapel. But with pigs.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.59,0:25:30.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的兄弟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brother!!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.57,0:25:32.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的兄弟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.54,0:25:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,格鲁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gru!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.57,0:25:35.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,德鲁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dru!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.57,0:25:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟 我要用力拥抱你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ahhhh! Brother! I am hugging you!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.52,0:25:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好高兴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.54,0:25:53.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,过了这么多年 我终于见到你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}After all these years, finally I'm meeting you!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.58,0:25:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对 可以了 好了 - 哦 看看这一位{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yup, alright, good. - Oh, look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.58,0:26:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定是漂亮的妻子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must be the beautiful wife!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.50,0:26:03.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说漂亮 真是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beautiful, oh. Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.52,0:26:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘴巴真甜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweet talker.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.50,0:26:07.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我兄弟怎么会找到你这种美女呢 他还顶着个秃头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is my brother finding a wife like you when he is so bald?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.50,0:26:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们一定是我的侄女们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These must be my nieces!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.52,0:26:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是艾格尼丝 人很小但是眼睛大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're Agnes, you're small with big eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.50,0:26:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,真想把你放进我的口袋里面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it makes me want to put you in my pocket!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.53,0:26:24.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本不可能啦 我太大了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't do that. I'm too big.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.56,0:26:26.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊迪丝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Edith,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.52,0:26:29.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我敢说你肯定是个爱捣乱的小淘气鬼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can tell that you are a little mischievous.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.57,0:26:32.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们两个待会儿一起去捣个乱吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going to have to make a little trouble later.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.53,0:26:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经做完了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I already have!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.57,0:26:38.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下 拜托 你们干什么要踢我呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, stop. Why are you doing that?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.54,0:26:39.50,Note,0,0,0,0,,（踢我）
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.58,0:26:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,碰个拳头 你真的很会捣乱哟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fist bump for mischievous behavior.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.53,0:26:46.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有玛格 你看着真成熟呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Margo! Oh, you are so mature.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.53,0:26:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来猜一下 你十五岁了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm guessing what, you're fifteen?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.51,0:26:50.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,十五岁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fifteen?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.54,0:26:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,她才十二岁 看着是十二岁 以后也一直是十二岁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's twelve! She looks twelve. And will always be twelve.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.50,0:26:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 德鲁 这里真的太棒了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Dru? this place is amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.51,0:27:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说一进门就让人忍不住 哇哦 哇哦 哇哦 哇哦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you just walk through the doors and you're like: wooooowwwooowwooooo!!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.59,0:27:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不错 大概吧 是的 我不是太在意物质{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eh. It's nice, I guess, sure. I'm not really into 'things.'
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.50,0:27:11.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,娃 真是太酷了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow! This is so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.51,0:27:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊 他甚至还有一架直升机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh my gosh, he's even got a helicopter!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.55,0:27:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直帅呆了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.56,0:27:17.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 帅呆了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.59,0:27:20.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好了 我们现在回家吧 - 回家 为什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right, let's go home now. - Home? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.53,0:27:23.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 这个家伙 住着豪宅 开着豪车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, this guy, with the mansion and the cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.50,0:27:28.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且还顶着像丝绸一样光滑 奢侈的长发{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and all the hair, silky-smooth, luxurious hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.57,0:27:31.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在比来之前感觉更糟了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel worse than I did before I came.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.51,0:27:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他是你的兄弟呀 格鲁 给他一个机会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, but he's your brother, Gru. Give him a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.59,0:27:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在想 我和格鲁单独交流兄弟感情的时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I was thinking, while Gru and I catch up on some brother stuff,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.55,0:27:40.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,女孩儿们就都跟着弗里茨玩吧 他给你们准备了惊喜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you girls should go with Fritz. He has a surprise for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.52,0:27:41.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好呀 - 好呀 - 太棒了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yay! - Yay! - Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.55,0:27:42.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最喜欢惊喜了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love surprises!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.58,0:27:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这太好了 母女们的亲子活动时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, this is perfect. Mother, daughter bonding time.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.50,0:27:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们快走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.54,0:27:49.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 你们好好玩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye! You boys have fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.57,0:27:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,好呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoopee!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.53,0:27:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在购买坏蛋布拉特玩具 你就能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you can be as evil as Balthazar Bratt.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.57,0:28:00.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,成为他那样的坏小子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the evil Bratt action figure,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.52,0:28:03.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,玩偶安装着伴随音乐启动的霹雳舞模式{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}featuring music activated Break Dance mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.59,0:28:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且配备了一对能够发射泡泡糖的垫肩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Also featuring bubble gum launching shoulder pads.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.52,0:28:12.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有全新的超级钻石激光{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the all new Mega Diamond Laser.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.58,0:28:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,数学滚开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more math!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.55,0:28:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可是个坏小子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been a bad boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.51,0:28:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,超级钻石激光并不能烧掉数学书{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mega Diamond Laser does not actually incinerate books.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.50,0:28:28.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,好莱坞怎么能停播这个节目儿呢 这些玩具多好玩啊 克里夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could Hollywood cancel a show that produced toys like this, Clive?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.54,0:28:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,坏蛋布拉特是真正的杰作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evil Bratt was a masterpiece.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.59,0:28:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,就没有人懂得珍惜真正的艺术吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does no one value true art anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.55,0:28:35.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 这真是一种是耻辱与嘲弄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a disgrace and a travesty, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.56,0:28:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 现在我拿到钻石了 报仇的时候到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, now that I've got the diamond, it's payback time.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.56,0:28:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,格鲁那个家伙没跳出来阻止我 真的是太可惜了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it's too bad Gru won't be around to try and stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.55,0:28:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢着 不准说 我讨厌那个呆子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, wait! No, it's not! I hate that tweeb!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.51,0:28:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,至于你 好莱坞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you, Hollywood!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.50,0:28:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一次 该我来废掉你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This time, I'm canceling you!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.52,0:28:54.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有曾经拒绝我的失败者们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And all the losers who rejected me!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.58,0:29:01.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 猪猪 猪猪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooooo, piggy, piggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.55,0:29:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 你最近还顺利吗 我是说工作方面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how are things going for you, career-wise?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.51,0:29:06.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊哈哈 顺利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ahhaaaaa, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.59,0:29:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,特别 特别好 一级棒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, so great. Crushing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.59,0:29:16.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我准备了一些东西 我想你会觉得很有趣的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I've got something that I think you will find very interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.58,0:29:20.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好 哥哥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on to your face, Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.56,0:29:42.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,小香肠{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh? Ah! Salami!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.56,0:29:45.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我抓到了小香肠{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I got Salami.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.53,0:29:47.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的是的是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.52,0:29:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,是小香肠{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Salami.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.50,0:29:52.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来快来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.51,0:29:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这都是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.52,0:30:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,养猪场只是真正的家族生意的幌子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The pig farm was just a cover for the real family business.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.53,0:30:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是有咪咪的格鲁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Gru with boobs!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.53,0:30:12.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,请欣赏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, feast your eyes on.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.53,0:30:17.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爸的密室{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad's lair! Ta-da!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.57,0:30:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等等 等一下 所以我们老爸是一个坏蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa whoa whoa, wait. So our dad was a villain?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.54,0:30:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不 不是随便一个坏蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. Not just a villain.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.57,0:30:28.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,是有史以来最棒的坏蛋之一{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But one of the greatest of all time!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.54,0:30:32.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他被称作恐怖秃子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was known as the Bald terror.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.57,0:30:35.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是他 我们的老爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's him? Our dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.59,0:30:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他非常以你为傲 你当年是个多么棒的坏蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was so proud of you. And what a great villain you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.51,0:30:41.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.54,0:30:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,但对我 就不是这样了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But me, not so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.58,0:30:50.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,对老爸来说 我就是个失败者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To Dad, I was just a failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.54,0:30:53.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一直都觉得我没有成为坏蛋的潜质{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He never thought I had what it took to be a villain.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.54,0:30:57.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是现在 你可以帮我证明他错了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now you can help me prove him wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.53,0:31:02.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥哥 教我坏蛋的艺术吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brother, teach me the art of villainy!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.56,0:31:06.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不不 我不能这样做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, no, no. I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.58,0:31:11.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 但这是我们的家族传统 你不能拒绝这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? But it's our family tradition! You can't say no to that!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.58,0:31:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我很抱歉 我放下那种生活了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm sorry. I've left that life behind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.53,0:31:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就这么简单 - 哦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- End of story. - Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.57,0:31:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我理解{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.51,0:31:23.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想知道这是干什么用的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wonder what this does?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.54,0:31:26.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命 救命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help. Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.55,0:31:27.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No no no…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.53,0:31:41.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的老天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holey moley!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.57,0:31:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爸的坏蛋专车 很棒吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad's villain wheels. Pretty slick, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.57,0:31:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想开出去兜兜风吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you want to take her out for a spin?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.51,0:31:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,就玩玩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just for some fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.53,0:32:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.54,0:32:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天天气真好啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a beautiful day!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.53,0:32:10.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,从零加速到四百码只要三秒 能承受核爆冲击{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zero to 400 in 3 seconds. Able to withstand a nuclear blast,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.58,0:32:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,全副武装{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}armed to the teeth!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.53,0:32:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这挺棒的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh yeah. That's pretty nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.57,0:32:20.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还是混合动力的 - 小心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And it's a hybrid. - LOOK OUT!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.51,0:32:44.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,救救我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah! Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.51,0:32:50.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可一点也不喜欢这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not enjoying this…!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.50,0:33:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 这里在干什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa. What is going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.55,0:33:05.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到一年一度的逍遥乡芝士节{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to the annual Freedonian Cheese Festival!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.54,0:33:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.50,0:33:14.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 看 看这些糖果{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh. Look. Look. Look at all the candies.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.51,0:33:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.55,0:33:20.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,露西 我们能吃点这个吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucy, can we get these please?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.52,0:33:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以 但是每人只能吃一块 我认真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, but only one each. I mean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.59,0:33:24.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 啊 - 真是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Awww. - Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.59,0:33:27.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我开玩笑的 想吃多少吃多少{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I don't! Get as many as you want,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.53,0:33:28.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我才不管呢 - 耶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't care! - Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.58,0:33:29.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.59,0:33:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 呃 - 怎么了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Um. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.50,0:33:35.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候也可以和她们说不 你知道吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay to tell them no sometimes, too, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.54,0:33:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈也需要严厉一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moms need to be tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.50,0:33:38.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 对 严厉 说得好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Right, tough. Good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.59,0:33:42.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我肯定能做到 我还在搞清楚当妈的这些事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can totally do that. You know, still figuring out this mom thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.56,0:33:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,适应新工作 老哥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Getting my sea legs, matie!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.54,0:33:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,独角兽{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a unicorn!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.57,0:33:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能去那里吗 求求求求求你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we go in there! Please please please please please?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.52,0:33:59.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 行啊 行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, sure, Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.55,0:34:02.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 咱们先 看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But first, let's, um, ooh, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.58,0:34:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,是逍遥乡传统舞蹈 多神奇啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a traditional Freedonian dance! How amazing does that look?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.56,0:34:12.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,芝士 我爱死这个了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chee! I love this.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.57,0:34:15.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些小姑娘们从那些小伙子们那里拿芝士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The little girls go and get the cheese from the little boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.58,0:34:17.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,太可爱了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.58,0:34:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,看那个可怜的小孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, look at that poor little guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.51,0:34:25.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿着那个小靴子 没人选他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}With his little boots. Nobody picked him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.53,0:34:28.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛戈 你过去一下呗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Margo, why don't you go up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.55,0:34:30.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不可能 - 好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No way! - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.50,0:34:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 不行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.52,0:34:35.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去尝尝他的芝士 小姑娘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go take a bite of his cheese, young lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.58,0:34:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.59,0:34:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,严厉一点啊 你说的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm being tougher. You know, like you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.51,0:34:43.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 我说对她们严厉点 不是我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I meant be tougher on them, not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.51,0:34:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦 你就去吧 还能出多大的乱子吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on, just do it. What's the worst that could happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.52,0:34:50.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.54,0:34:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 我叫玛戈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey there, I'm Margo.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.58,0:35:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 玛戈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Margo.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.58,0:35:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫尼科 你想尝尝我的芝士吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am Niko. Would you like some of my cheese?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.55,0:35:12.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了太好了太好了 谢谢你 玛戈 谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, yes, yes! Thank you, Margo! Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.57,0:35:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个好妈妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}BAM! I am a great mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.50,0:35:19.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们看到了吗 姑娘们 我放下了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see that, girls? I lay down the…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.56,0:35:22.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 她们在哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh no. Where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.54,0:35:24.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾格尼丝 伊迪斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agnes! Edith!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.54,0:35:28.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.59,0:35:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 一个独角兽的角{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, look! A unicorn horn!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.54,0:35:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的小脑袋要爆炸啦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My little brain is going to explode!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.52,0:35:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 艾格尼丝 那是假的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ugh, Agnes. That's a fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.51,0:35:45.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,那绝对是真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ohhhh, it's real alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.57,0:35:49.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个角来自扭曲森林{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That horn came from the Crooked Forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.53,0:35:54.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有这个地方独角兽还生活着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only place on earth where unicorns still live.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.51,0:36:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,笑吧 笑吧 你们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Laugh! Laugh, all of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.58,0:36:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都觉得我疯了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They all think I'm crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.57,0:36:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我告诉你 我见过一次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm telling you, I saw one once.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.51,0:36:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲眼所见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}With my own eye!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.51,0:36:14.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下等一下等一下 你见过一个真的 活的 独角兽{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait. You saw a for-real, live unicorn?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.55,0:36:15.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,它长什么样子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did it look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.50,0:36:18.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有摸摸它 它是不是闻起来像糖一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you pet it? Did it smell like candy?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.51,0:36:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是不是毛绒绒的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was it fluffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.52,0:36:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,它那么毛绒绒的 我都要死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was so fluffy I thought I was going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.55,0:36:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我能不能找到一只呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think maybe I could find one, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.52,0:36:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,据说如果一个少女的纯洁的心走进扭曲森林{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They say if a maiden pure of heart goes into the Crooked Forest,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.51,0:36:40.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,独角兽就会出来 然后永远属于她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the unicorn will come and be hers forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.57,0:36:48.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾格尼丝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agnes!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.56,0:36:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,进球{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goal!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.55,0:36:56.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.54,0:36:59.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,姑娘们 别担心 我来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Girls! Don't worry, I'm here!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.56,0:37:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们还好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.54,0:37:04.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还好 你还好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we're fine. Are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.57,0:37:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,独角兽真的是真的 我要去找一只{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unicorns are really real! And I'm gonna find one!!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.50,0:37:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 护崽心切了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, I went a little mama bear on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.57,0:37:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听到了尖叫声{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I heard a scream and?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.56,0:37:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 祝你开心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}yeah, okay. Have a good one!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.59,0:37:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在这里等我 - 不要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait for me here! - Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.50,0:37:27.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下 你踹到我了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop that! Ow! You kicked me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.55,0:37:31.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿 你在干什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Hey! What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.56,0:37:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你偷了糖果吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you just steal candies?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.55,0:37:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.51,0:37:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了两根棒棒糖下这么大功夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was a lot of effort for two lollipops.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.52,0:37:43.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好 警察{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh no! The police!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.57,0:37:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么办 怎么办{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we do? What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.57,0:37:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,上车 接下来要好玩了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! This is going to be fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.52,0:38:01.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察要抓到我们了 我好害怕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The police are going to get us! I'm freaking out!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.55,0:38:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,刹车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brakes!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.53,0:38:06.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cops!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.53,0:38:24.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 他们回来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, they're back!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.55,0:38:50.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,老兄 这太疯狂了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, that was crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.57,0:38:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们差一点就被抓到了 - 还用你说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're so close to getting busted. - Tell me about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.54,0:38:56.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你要尿裤子了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you were going to pee your pants!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.53,0:38:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我尿了 - 你尿了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I did! - You did!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.59,0:39:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅尔 累死我了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mel, tired…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.58,0:39:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 梅尔 等一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ugh. Hey, Mel. Hold on a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.50,0:39:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们好累 好渴 好饿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're tired, thirsty, and hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.54,0:39:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 梅尔 我好累 - 梅尔 我好饿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mel, tired. - Mel, hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.59,0:39:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,披萨 在哪 吃的 意面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's pizza. Over there. Our food, spaghetti!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.57,0:39:22.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,披萨 披萨 披萨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pizza! Pizza! Pizza!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.58,0:39:27.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,披萨 披萨 披萨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pizza! Pizza! Pizza!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.54,0:39:29.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在干什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.55,0:39:31.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人闯入 有人闯入{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Intruders! Intruders!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.50,0:39:40.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下 你 别动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop! Hey, you! Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.52,0:39:41.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,停{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Halt!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.52,0:39:48.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,快叫支援{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call for backup!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.50,0:39:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟上 跟上 快走 快走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on. Let's go, keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.54,0:39:55.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.54,0:39:57.55,Note,0,0,0,0,,（达人秀）
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.56,0:40:08.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,高兴了吧 都怪你 做些什么啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happy? It's on you. Do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.51,0:40:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要 不要 不要 不要 不要 不要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.54,0:40:52.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住他们 快 快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get 'em! Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.56,0:41:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 别动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you! Freeze!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.59,0:41:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.53,0:41:36.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,手举起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hands in the air!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.56,0:41:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,面对现实吧 格鲁 当坏蛋的本性就在你的血液里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Face it, Gru. Villainy is in your blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.54,0:41:50.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不可能告诉我你不怀念这种快感 一点都没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't tell me you don't miss the rush. A little?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.54,0:41:53.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 也许有一点吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well… Yeah, maybe a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.55,0:41:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你有了一个回到巅峰的机会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now you've got a chance to get back on top.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.52,0:41:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,找回你的魔力 重新做回格鲁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get your mojo back. Become Gru again!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.51,0:42:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这要有多棒啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How awesome would that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.56,0:42:07.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你了 来吧 就偷一次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh please, come on, just one heist.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.59,0:42:11.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界上肯定有某个东西 在某个地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's got to be something out there, somewhere,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.58,0:42:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还想偷走的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you still want to steal.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.59,0:42:20.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 倒是有个东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmmmm… There is something.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.53,0:42:26.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去把世界上最大的钻石偷走怎么样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about we steal the largest diamond in the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.55,0:42:29.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我喜欢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes! I love it!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.56,0:42:31.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 哥哥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, thank you, Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.52,0:42:34.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发自内心地谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you from the bottom of my heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.54,0:42:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该庆祝一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! You know what? We should do something to celebrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.56,0:42:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有一个完美的主意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ohhhh. I've got the perfect idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.55,0:42:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗里茨 好同志{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fritz, my good fellow.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.58,0:42:49.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能再给我拿一块餐巾吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you get me another napkin, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.57,0:42:52.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 当然 伊迪斯小姐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh yes, of course, Miss Edith.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.52,0:43:00.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,格鲁和德鲁去哪了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, where are Gru and Dru?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.58,0:43:03.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we are!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.53,0:43:05.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.52,0:43:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我 格鲁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's me, Gru.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.50,0:43:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 德鲁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And me, Dru.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.59,0:43:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和所有人拥抱 不管他们喜不喜欢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hug everybody whether they like it or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.50,0:43:17.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们为什么要假装是对方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are they pretending to be each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.51,0:43:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚饭吃什么 我估计不会喜欢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's for dinner? I probably won't like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.55,0:43:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕竟我一直都这么暴躁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so grumpy all the time!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.54,0:43:27.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我笑个不停{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! I laugh a lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.57,0:43:30.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有点傻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm kind of an idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.59,0:43:41.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我肚子好疼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, a bust in the gut.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.58,0:43:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,看她们 完全看不出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at them! They had no idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.50,0:43:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全骗到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Total burn.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.56,0:43:49.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 是我 格鲁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, look, it's me…Gru!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.57,0:43:53.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是德鲁 我们互换了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm Dru! We switched places!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.52,0:43:55.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,看你们两个相处得这么好真棒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awww. It's so nice to see you two are getting along.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.56,0:43:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们相处得 - 太好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, we're getting… - Along perfectly.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.52,0:44:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等等 我们是不是 - 接了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait. Did we… - Just finish…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.57,0:44:01.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对 - 方的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Each… - Other's…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.57,0:44:03.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 话 - 话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sentences? - Sentences?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.51,0:44:06.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真棒 一点也不诡异{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw, that's delightful. Not creepy at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.57,0:44:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过你们要停下来了 是吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're gonna stop now, though, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.52,0:44:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 双胞胎之间的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, it's a twin thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.55,0:44:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,行吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.50,0:44:15.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你们两个今天干什么了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So… what did you guys do today?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.59,0:44:17.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没什么 - 没什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nothing! - Nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.50,0:44:19.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. What is it…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.51,0:44:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃完了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All done!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.59,0:44:23.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,闪开 晚安各位{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out of the way! Good night, everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.59,0:44:26.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等等等 停一下 你急什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, hey, put the brakes on. What's the rush?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.55,0:44:29.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去睡觉了这样我能起来去找独角兽{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to go to bed so I can wake up and find a unicorn!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.53,0:44:30.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.54,0:44:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that about?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.59,0:44:37.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾格尼丝觉得她明天会在树林里找到一只真的独角兽{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agnes thinks she's going to find a real unicorn in the woods tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.58,0:44:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,她都要抓狂了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's totally freaking out.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.50,0:44:42.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得有人要去告诉她真相{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel like someone got's to tell her the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.54,0:44:43.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not it!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.57,0:44:45.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ohhh, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.55,0:44:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是育儿的基础知识 我来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Parenting 101. I've got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.53,0:44:53.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,请保佑当我找到独角兽的时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ummm… And please bless that when I find the unicorn,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.56,0:44:56.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会和我一起回家 睡在我的房间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}he'll want to come home with me. And sleep in my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.56,0:44:59.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以每天骑他上学{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that I can ride him to school every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.59,0:45:03.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会用他的魔法帮我做数学题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he will use his magical powers to help me do math.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.56,0:45:04.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.52,0:45:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 格鲁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Hi, Gru.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.57,0:45:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 明天是个大日子啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. So big day tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.57,0:45:16.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,对啊 我终于能看到独角兽了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm finally going to get to see a unicorn!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.54,0:45:17.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For reals.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.52,0:45:21.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我找到了 我能带它回家吗 求求你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I do, can I bring it home, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.53,0:45:23.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 好啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ohhh. Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.54,0:45:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉你 你找到的独角兽{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell you what, every unicorn you find,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.53,0:45:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,都可以带回家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can bring it home.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.50,0:45:31.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最好建高大的围栏 对吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd better build a big pen, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.59,0:45:34.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你知道吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.55,0:45:38.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,有可能你就是找不到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's a chance that you might not find one.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.56,0:45:41.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.58,0:45:46.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许现在不是独角兽活动的季节{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It might not be good unicorn finding weather.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.50,0:45:52.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们不好找{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're tricky to find them.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.53,0:45:54.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不清楚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.53,0:46:03.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许 只是 也许独角兽并不真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe, just… maybe unicorns don't really ex…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.51,0:46:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,会在森林那面活动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…explore that part of the woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.51,0:46:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那个人说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the man said.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.54,0:46:16.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,心灵纯净的少女能够找到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}a maiden could find one if she was pure of heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.56,0:46:19.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我心灵很纯净吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm pure of heart, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.50,0:46:21.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,最纯净的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The purest.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.50,0:46:29.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能不聊了吗 我想睡觉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we stop talking now? I need to get to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.55,0:46:31.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安 亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodnight, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.51,0:46:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安 格鲁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodnight, Gru.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.58,0:46:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱独角兽 我爱独角兽{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unicorns I love them. Unicorns I love them.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.54,0:46:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.58,0:46:49.55,Note,0,0,0,0,,（州立监狱）
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.52,0:46:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,还给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Give that back!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.52,0:46:56.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh? Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.56,0:46:58.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,大伙 别离开我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys! Don't leave me!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.59,0:47:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要 快跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.53,0:47:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们等很久了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been waiting a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.59,0:47:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No. Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.55,0:47:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 别这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Please, don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.50,0:47:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,格鲁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gru?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.58,0:48:01.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的飞机 坏了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My plane… broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.57,0:48:27.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们 我决定了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buddies, I've decided.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.54,0:48:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要回去找格鲁 我们要回去找锅炉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going back to Gru. We're going back to Gru!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.57,0:48:40.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我为了那个大日子一直在训练{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I'm training for the big day,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.55,0:48:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人能阻拦我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}nobody's gonna stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.53,0:48:48.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我脸皮超级厚 超级厚 超级厚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause I am super sassy. Super sassy. Super sassy.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.50,0:48:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天什么计划 老大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's today's plan, boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.51,0:48:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么计划{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.58,0:48:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,傻机器人 我让你看看是什么计划{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Silly robot. I'll show you the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.51,0:48:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候观看一集非常特别的布拉特小坏蛋了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time to watch a very special episode of Evil Bratt.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.52,0:49:02.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看我到底要如何对付那个浮夸的傻瓜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to see exactly what I'm going to do to stupid Tinseltown.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.54,0:49:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,本周的布拉特小坏蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This week on "Evil Bratt".
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.51,0:49:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,布拉特小坏蛋机器巨人来了 开火{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a giant Evil Bratt robot! Open fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.50,0:49:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,想得美 条子们 给你们嚼嚼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice try, coppers. Chew on this!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.58,0:49:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他发射了独门的超黏自发泡泡糖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's shooting his super sticky self inflating gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.53,0:49:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.55,0:49:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为泡泡 泡泡为我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gum one! Gum all!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.59,0:49:36.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为泡泡 泡泡为我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gum one. Gum all.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.53,0:49:39.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,说真的 这节目怎么没得艾美奖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously, how did this show never win an Emmy?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.51,0:49:46.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 我的钻石 是你发挥威力的时候了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now, it's your turn to shine, my diamond!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.59,0:49:58.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,克里夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Clive.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.59,0:50:03.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以说我们的计划是 打败世界{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess you can say our plan was… out of this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.51,0:50:09.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,娱乐时间结束了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that's entertainment.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.58,0:50:12.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 我们去把它变成现实{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Let's make it a reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.50,0:50:19.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来了 在黑暗扭曲古怪的森林{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we are, in the dark and creepy Crooked Forest,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.56,0:50:21.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,寻找神秘的独角兽{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in search of the mythical unicorn.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.58,0:50:23.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了某种原因{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For some reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.52,0:50:26.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,她来了 无畏的独角兽猎手 寻找{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And here she is, the fearless unicorn hunter, seeking the…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.56,0:50:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊迪丝 别闹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Edith, stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.50,0:50:30.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会吓跑独角兽的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna scare away the unicorn!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.53,0:50:32.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我们刚好找到了独角兽{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If somehow we actually find a unicorn,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.57,0:50:34.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要把它录下来靠它赚钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna film it and get rich.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.57,0:50:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,看那边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.51,0:50:41.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这里了 我们会在这里发现它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is it! This is where we're gonna see it!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.53,0:50:45.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,独角兽 我们来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unicorns, here we come.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.55,0:50:46.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that for?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.55,0:50:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,诱饵 没见识了吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bait. Duh.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.55,0:50:49.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.50,0:50:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们只需要等了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now all we have to do is wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.53,0:51:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 这里是布拉特的巢穴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. This is Bratt's lair.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.51,0:51:02.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许看起来不怎么样 但这里装备了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It may not look like much, but this place is armed.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.52,0:51:05.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类史上最厉害的高科技武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}with some of the most high-tech weaponry known to man.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.53,0:51:07.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,是刀枪不入的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's considered impenetrable.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.55,0:51:10.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,但对我们来说是小菜一碟 对吧 哥哥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But a piece of cake for us, right, Brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.56,0:51:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这和偷棒棒糖可不一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not like stealing lollipops.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.54,0:51:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个安全系统能侦查任何方向来的空袭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This security system can detect an air assault from any direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.50,0:51:27.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.56,0:51:29.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.52,0:51:31.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 停手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please! Stop! Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.59,0:51:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只能在下面通过 在水边行动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we'll have to approach low and close to the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.56,0:51:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.53,0:51:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有这些致命的长钉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then there are these deadly spikes.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.57,0:51:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰罗尼莫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha ha ha ha! Geronimo!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.57,0:51:49.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面涂的毒药足以让你震惊 真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Covered with enough poison to blow your mind… literally.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.54,0:51:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好痛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ouch! Ha ha ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.54,0:51:52.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不可不知{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah… Good to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.59,0:51:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,计划是这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So here's the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.51,0:51:57.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当逃跑时开车的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the getaway driver.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.53,0:51:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你在船上等着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you'll wait in the boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.57,0:52:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,等下 在船上等着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, hold on. Wait in the boat?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.59,0:52:04.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,但 我想参与行动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But… I want to be in on the actions!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.51,0:52:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,逃跑司机是任何行动中最重要的部分{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The getaway driver is the most crucial part of any plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.52,0:52:13.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道坐着什么都不做 什么都不碰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know how hard it is doing nothing, touching nothing,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.58,0:52:16.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,肾上腺素却充满了你的静脉有多难{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}with all of the adrenaline coursing through your veins.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.59,0:52:18.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你也必须等待{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you must wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.56,0:52:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能指望你吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I count on you?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.56,0:52:23.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess so?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.54,0:52:27.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后 我会爬上魔方 从这里进入{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So… I'll climb up the cube and enter here.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.53,0:52:29.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我进去后 会找到钻石{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then once I'm inside, I'll find the diamond.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.59,0:52:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾小看过布拉特 这不会那么简单{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've underestimated Bratt before. It's not going to be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.50,0:52:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该能对付{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we can handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.58,0:52:42.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸的坏蛋服 这会让我们所向披靡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad's villain suits! This will make us unstoppable.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.56,0:52:44.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,真帅啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa. Ay, chihuahua!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.59,0:52:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要黑的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I call the black one!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.50,0:52:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,该出发了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's go time!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.57,0:53:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello. Oh, hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.53,0:53:07.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 玛格的母亲 我是尼科{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, mother of Margo. I am Niko.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.54,0:53:12.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我将这只猪献给你代表我对与您女儿订婚的诚意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I present you with pig to confirm my engagement to your daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.58,0:53:16.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么回事 - 发生了什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, what now? - What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.53,0:53:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,还记得 小靴子吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember, little boots?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.58,0:53:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 我的爱人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, my schmoopsie poo.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.52,0:53:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他似乎觉得你们订婚了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He seems to think you're engaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.53,0:53:26.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 我们才没订婚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? We're not engaged!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.55,0:53:29.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 尼科 你似乎是个好人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Niko. You seem like a very nice boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.56,0:53:31.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,小猪也很可爱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}With a very nice pig.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.51,0:53:33.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你们没订婚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, but you're not engaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.51,0:53:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? It's not happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.57,0:53:39.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我理解 我在骗谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand. Who was I kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.57,0:53:43.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这样的牛粪怎么配得上你这样的女神{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A dumpling like me with a goddess like you?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.58,0:53:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我向你保证 我绝不会忘记你 玛格{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I promise: I will never forget you, Margo.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.52,0:53:49.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.59,0:53:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕我也不会忘记你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm pretty sure I won't forget you, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.56,0:53:55.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 尼科{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye. Bye, Niko.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.50,0:53:58.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚才太出乎意料了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow, that was crazy! Wooo!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.55,0:54:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,真丢人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was totally humiliating!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.57,0:54:03.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,非要咬一口那奶酪是我做过最愚蠢的事了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taking a bite of that cheese was the stupidest thing I've ever done.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.50,0:54:05.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当时为什么听了你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did I listen to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.54,0:54:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 但都结束了 所以{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, but it's over now, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.58,0:54:10.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,又来了 尼科{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ugh, here we go. Niko…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.53,0:54:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 你拒绝了我儿子的订婚猪吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You! You refuse my son's engagement pig?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.59,0:54:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.55,0:54:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你和你女儿痛苦地慢慢死去 和洋葱埋在一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}May you and your daughter die a slow death and be buried with onions!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.58,0:54:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了 女士 够了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright, lady. That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.56,0:54:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人 没人 能骂我的女儿 明白吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody… nobody! …curses my daughter! You got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.50,0:54:32.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你敢惹玛格 就是惹我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because if you mess with Margo, you mess with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.50,0:54:37.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我向你保证 你绝不想惹我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I promise, you do not want to mess with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.54,0:54:39.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,听明白了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you understand me?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.58,0:54:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.59,0:54:43.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 滚吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Now, GET!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.51,0:54:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 玛格 我们只需要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Margo. I think we just need to… Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.55,0:54:54.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.58,0:54:57.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得告诉格鲁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! I've to tell Gru!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.52,0:55:15.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们能回去了吗 - 这么快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can we go back now? - Already?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.58,0:55:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,再坚持几小时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a couple more hours!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.56,0:55:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得在天黑前回家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to be home before it gets dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.59,0:55:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.50,0:55:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我完全照着那个人说的做了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did exactly what the man said.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.53,0:55:28.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说那个被所有人嘲笑的人独眼刀疤仔吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean that one-eyed, scar-faced man that everybody laughed at?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.57,0:55:30.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 不可能啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. It makes no sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.50,0:55:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 艾格妮丝 也许我们没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Agnes, maybe we're not…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.50,0:55:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的一生都在等这一时刻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My whole life has been building to this moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.52,0:55:55.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um. It's a…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.55,0:55:57.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,独角兽{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unicorn!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.51,0:56:01.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不敢相信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.57,0:56:04.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要叫你小吉祥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna name you Lucky!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.55,0:56:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,小吉祥 别舔了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Lucky, stop it…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.57,0:56:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 还是让别人打破她的梦吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I'll let someone else burst her bubble.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.51,0:56:21.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看我们 雄雄双煞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at us! Two brothers pulling a heist.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.59,0:56:27.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那颗钻石会让我们成为最富有的人 世界最厉害的恶人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that diamond will make us the richest, most powerful villains in the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.57,0:56:29.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吧 哥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, Brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.53,0:56:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Yeah. Yeah…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.59,0:56:39.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 好极了 你真棒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bravo! Bravissimo! You're amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.58,0:56:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真抱歉 真不好意思 我之前很无理{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry. I'm so embarrassed. I was very rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.52,0:56:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你一直大人不记小人过 - 你成功了 你成功了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And you were always such a gentleman. - You did it! You did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.55,0:56:46.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找回了我们的工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got our jobs back.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.05,0:56:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 当然 很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Oh yeah. Right. Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.00,0:56:56.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,看啊 我们到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh look, we're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.07,0:57:06.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要进去了 拿好方向盘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going in. Take the wheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.01,0:57:08.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是不明白为什么不能和你一起去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still don't see why I can't go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.07,0:57:10.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们讨论过了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Hey, we discussed this.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.03,0:57:12.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在不是破坏计划的时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now is not the time to mess with the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.07,0:57:14.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.08,0:57:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哥 - 怎么了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, brother. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.06,0:57:32.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了 你应该待在船上的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you, you were supposed to stay with the boat!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.03,0:57:35.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没想到真的是字面的意思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I didn't think you meant that literally.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.03,0:57:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然我是啥意思呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What other way could I have meant it?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.03,0:57:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 听我指挥 跟我走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright. Let's move. Just follow my lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.08,0:57:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.07,0:57:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,救救我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me! Ow! Ow! Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.08,0:57:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 毒刺{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh no! The poison spikes!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.00,0:57:53.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要被刺穿了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm gonna be impaled!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.05,0:57:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha ha! I'm okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.01,0:58:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想小黄人了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I miss the Minions.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.00,0:58:01.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跟上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.03,0:58:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.06,0:58:15.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.06,0:58:21.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.06,0:58:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这有扫描仪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a scanning device!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.03,0:58:30.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,快转变 伪装模式{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quick… camouflage mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.08,0:58:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动 闭眼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freeze! And close your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.08,0:58:35.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,捂上嘴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And cover your mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.04,0:58:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 抓住我的手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Take my hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.04,0:59:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha ha. Follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.05,0:59:34.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.02,0:59:41.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是对的 我应该留在船上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right. I should've stay in the boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.05,0:59:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有点反胃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My stomach feels all queasy.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.04,0:59:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不该吃那个热馅饼的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shouldn't have eaten that hot pie.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.06,0:59:51.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,别紧张{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Hey. Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.01,0:59:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会没事的 我保护你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to be just fine. I got your back.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.01,1:00:02.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来 这边走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, this way.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.08,1:00:06.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,格鲁会拿这个 格鲁会拿那个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gru would take this. Gru would take that.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.08,1:00:08.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,快行动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.04,1:00:10.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得 这边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eh. Peter, that way.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.01,1:00:11.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.01,1:00:34.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go. Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.05,1:00:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,快回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh? Hey, come back.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.05,1:01:02.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 你好 你好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello. Hello. Hello.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.04,1:01:11.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,救生外套就在你们身边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You jacket is located within easy reach.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.04,1:01:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉开栓扣为救生衣充气 像这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inflate your jacket by pulling the toggle. Like this…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.03,1:01:16.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢你们的关注 祝您旅途愉快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank for your attention, enjoy your flight.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.03,1:01:26.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,直走 直走 直走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Straight ahead. Straight ahead. Straight ahead.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.07,1:01:30.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们 等等我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bud-Buddy. Bud-Buddy!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.08,1:01:33.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等我啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buddyyyy!!!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.03,1:01:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,似乎就在我们头顶上方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It looks like it's right above us.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.01,1:01:38.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该怎么办 应该在通风孔等着吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay! What do I do? Should I wait in the vent?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.07,1:01:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 跟我走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.07,1:01:58.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想感谢奥斯卡评委会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I'd like to thank the Academy.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.05,1:02:02.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我能拿 - 不行 别上手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can… - No no no no no…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.01,1:02:04.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么 我可以的 - 别 别冲动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why? I can do it. - Don't, don't, don't!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.06,1:02:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 莫莉·林沃德 我会带你参加学校舞会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, yes, Molly Ringwald. I will take you to the prom.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.07,1:02:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where… What…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.06,1:02:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁在那 谁在那{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's there? Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.04,1:02:21.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,99个红气球{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ninety nine red balloons…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.03,1:02:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎呦 差点忘了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoops! Almost forgot.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.07,1:02:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shhh, shhh. Over here!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.07,1:02:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟紧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay close!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.07,1:02:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,娃娃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dolls.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.00,1:02:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来蠢到买这玩意的只有布拉特本人了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like Bratt was the only one stupid enough to buy this junk.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.09,1:02:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前也有一个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. I used to have one of these!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.03,1:02:59.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跟上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Shh! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.00,1:03:10.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们越来越近了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright. We're getting close.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.01,1:03:14.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,从现在开始 每一步必须极其小心有目的性{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}From now on, every move must be made with ultra precision and purpose.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.03,1:03:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,泡泡糖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gum!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.05,1:03:18.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,集中精力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Focus!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.04,1:04:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,入侵者 入侵者 入侵者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Intruders! Intruders! Intruders!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.07,1:04:04.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动 两个笨蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freeze, dipsticks!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.08,1:04:07.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,格鲁 你怎么有两个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gru! There's two of you now?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.04,1:04:10.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来能有双倍的乐子了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then this will be twice as much fun.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.08,1:04:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我的钻石还回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aaaaah! Give me back my diamond!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.01,1:04:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,全面封锁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Total lockdown!!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.01,1:04:23.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,小的们 抓住他们 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go get 'em, Bratt Pack!!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.05,1:04:34.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要抓到我们了 他们要抓到我们了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gonna get us! They're gonna get us!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.07,1:04:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.05,1:04:54.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要死了吗 我们要死了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}ARE WE GONNA DIE?? ARE WE GONNA DIE??
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.06,1:04:56.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}WE'RE GONNA DIE!!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.09,1:05:07.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.06,1:05:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们 撑住了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, guys. Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.09,1:05:12.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,露西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucy!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.05,1:05:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你救了我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for saving us! Woo!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.03,1:05:24.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 我们拿到钻石了 我们要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look! We got the diamond! And we're going to…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.08,1:05:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,带着他回到联盟 找回工作 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it to the AVL and get our jobs back!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.06,1:05:29.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.04,1:05:30.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 那太好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? That's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.00,1:05:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,最妙的是 你再也不用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the best part is you are never ever.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.02,1:05:38.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,背着我偷偷行动了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}go behind my back ever again!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.01,1:05:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 懂了吧 亲爱的 - 懂了 懂了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Right, honeybear? - Yup! Yup! Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.01,1:05:42.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,得到教训了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lesson learned.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.09,1:05:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去叫女儿们 然后打包行李宣布这个好消息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get the girls and start packing and tell them the good news!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.04,1:06:00.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能找回工作了 耶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, we're getting our jobs back, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.07,1:06:03.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 对 去告诉女儿们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Yes. Go tell the girls.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.09,1:06:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 没门 我们不能把钻石还回去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No way! We can't give the diamond back!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.01,1:06:10.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我必须这么做 - 你不用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I have to. - No, you don't!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.07,1:06:12.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我必须还 - 把它给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, I do. - Give it.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.06,1:06:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不行 - 给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No! - Give it!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.01,1:06:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗷 你是不是有毛病{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ow! What is wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.00,1:06:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是不是有毛病{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.03,1:06:18.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你踢了我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You kicked me!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.03,1:06:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 你骗了我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You-You lied to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.07,1:06:21.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本想告诉你真相{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. I would have told you the truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.07,1:06:24.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你就是个胆小鬼 根本接受不了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're too much of a wimp to handle it.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.07,1:06:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样 我走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it, I'm out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.02,1:06:29.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没权利拿走 我们俩一起偷的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no right to take that, we stole it together.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.02,1:06:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Together?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.02,1:06:32.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定是在逗我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.05,1:06:34.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你除了惹麻烦什么也没做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did nothing but screwed up the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.08,1:06:36.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样我还拿到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got this in spite of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.05,1:06:39.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 是吗 至少我不会像失败者一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah? Well, at least I didn't get fired.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.05,1:06:41.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,被老板开除丢掉工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}from my job like a total loser.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.09,1:06:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少我还有工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least I had a job.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.06,1:06:45.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你又做了什么值得骄傲的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have you accomplished that was so great?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.07,1:06:48.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我来告诉你 没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you what: Nothing!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.01,1:06:52.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,难怪老爹会认为你是个失败者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No wonder Dad thought you were such a failure.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.05,1:06:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们再也不是兄弟了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're no longer brothers!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.04,1:06:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我求之不得{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's fine with me!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.07,1:07:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,格鲁 我找到独角兽啦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gru! I found a unicorn!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.03,1:07:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的人生完美了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My life is complete!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.08,1:07:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 那 那其实不是真的独角兽{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, that's… that's not actually a unicorn.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.01,1:08:00.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他有个角{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But-But he has one horn.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.09,1:08:03.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 宝贝 但是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm-I'm sorry, sweetie, but…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.00,1:08:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就是只山羊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's just a goat.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.08,1:08:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候人生就是如此{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Life is just like that sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.00,1:08:12.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们期待的是独角兽{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're hoping for a unicorn.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.04,1:08:14.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,得到的却是山羊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we get a goat.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.05,1:08:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你知道么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you know what?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.06,1:08:22.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,小吉祥是世界上最可爱的山羊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucky is the best goat in the whole wide world!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.08,1:08:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看他的脸 我真的好想抱紧他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at that face! I just want to squeeze it.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.04,1:08:33.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来拿这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take this.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.01,1:08:36.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可真是个坏小子 格鲁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been a bad boy, Gru.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.02,1:08:38.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,把剩下的箱子拿过来好吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you get the rest of the suitcases?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.03,1:08:40.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,走了 姑娘们 我们走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, girls, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.01,1:08:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们动起来 动起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get physical, physical!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.08,1:08:52.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,计划有变 姑娘们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Change of plan, girls.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.09,1:08:55.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们暂时不回家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Instead of going home…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.01,1:08:57.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,眉毛 哎呀 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eyebrows. Ow!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.04,1:09:00.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去好莱坞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going to Hollywood!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.07,1:09:04.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到没 这就是演技{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that's what I call acting.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.03,1:09:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 克里夫 大机器人还等着我们呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go, Clive. We've got a giant robot waiting.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.09,1:09:16.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,露西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucy?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.05,1:09:19.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,布拉特 他劫走了女儿们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bratt, he took the girls!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.02,1:09:21.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? No!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.00,1:09:25.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,德鲁 德鲁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dru! Dru!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.09,1:09:28.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,走开 我不想和你说话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go away. I don't want to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.07,1:09:31.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,布拉特劫持了姑娘们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bratt has the girls!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.06,1:09:39.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 兄弟 之前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, brother. What…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.06,1:09:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我说的那些 - 不 是我先{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- About what I said. - No, I'm the one…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.09,1:09:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不该那么说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I shouldn't have…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.07,1:09:45.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 我对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm-I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.09,1:09:49.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是 格鲁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry, Gru.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.05,1:09:53.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,当心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, look out!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.02,1:09:54.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.01,1:09:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿 前面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Hey! In front of!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.05,1:10:00.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈呀 妈呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caramba! Caramba!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.04,1:10:03.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}CARAMBAAAAA!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.01,1:10:04.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mel?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.03,1:10:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,格鲁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gru?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.04,1:10:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,快给这玩意儿掉头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got to turn this thing around…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.06,1:10:11.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,格鲁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gru!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.07,1:10:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 格鲁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait up! GRUUUUU…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.01,1:10:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 好莱坞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Hollywood!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.05,1:10:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我回来了 而且更大了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm back and bigger than ever.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.03,1:10:49.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好害怕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm scared!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.08,1:10:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 谢谢大家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. Thank you so…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.01,1:11:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,别把我丢在这 我是大腕啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't leave me here! I'm famous!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.01,1:11:04.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,克里夫 装备加农炮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clive, arm the cannons.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.09,1:11:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,尝尝这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chew on this!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.01,1:11:28.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,大胡子 放我们出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, mullet-head. Let us out!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.07,1:11:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 姑娘们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, don't worry, girls.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.08,1:11:34.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你们准备了前排的座位{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've prepared a front row seat for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.01,1:11:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾格尼丝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agnes!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.02,1:11:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,又一次 我胜利了 格鲁输了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once again, I win and Gru loses.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.09,1:11:59.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好欣赏吧 姑娘们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enjoy the show, girls.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.05,1:12:08.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么鬼东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What in the heck?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.04,1:12:10.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,但愿孩子们都安全{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope the girls are okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.02,1:12:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,布拉特 兄弟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bratt! Brother!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.03,1:12:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,在9点钟方向 不 3点钟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}9 o'clock. No. 3 o'clock.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.05,1:12:15.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就在左边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's on the left!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.00,1:12:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我以前看过这一幕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh, no. I've seen this episode.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.04,1:12:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要用泡泡糖裹住整座城市{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's going to bubble gum the whole city.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.00,1:12:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后送进太空{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and send it up into space.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.02,1:12:24.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.03,1:12:37.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这样 就是这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is it. This is it.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.03,1:12:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,灯光 相机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lights! Camera!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.08,1:12:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,激光{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}LASER!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.07,1:12:56.05,Note,0,0,0,0,,（大世界唱片）
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.02,1:13:00.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 我去救她们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look. I got the girls.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.09,1:13:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩去对付布拉特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two go take care of Bratt.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.03,1:13:04.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你要做什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.02,1:13:11.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家快看 是露西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you guys. It's Lucy.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.08,1:13:14.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,露西 这里 救命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucy, over here. Help! Help us!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.02,1:13:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈来了 姑娘们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mama's coming, girls.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.00,1:13:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 露西 - 这里 露西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lucy! - Right here! Lucy!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.05,1:13:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧瞧那激光{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at that laser go.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.01,1:13:22.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就喜欢计划成功的感觉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love it when a plan comes together.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.04,1:13:25.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,是格鲁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aaaah! It's Gru!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.02,1:13:28.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好 布拉特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get ready, Bratt.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.07,1:13:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要把你打回80年代{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're about to be blasted back to the 80s.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.03,1:13:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们打败他了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah ho! We got him!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.07,1:13:56.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 糟了 - 别担心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh no. - Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.01,1:13:58.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的弹药多着呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's more where that came from.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.02,1:14:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,想阻止我可没那么容易{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll take more than that to stop me.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.08,1:14:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,小子们 去抓住那个死秃头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bratt pack, go get that barf bag.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.05,1:14:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, incoming!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.02,1:14:17.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个小{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, little…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.00,1:14:26.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 跳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quick! Jump!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.00,1:14:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boners!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.04,1:14:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到了没 克里夫 都完了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see that, Clive? All gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.01,1:14:35.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 神奇双胞胎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye bye, Wonder Twins.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.03,1:14:57.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,看那些巨型气泡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look are all those giant bubbles!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.02,1:15:04.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.07,1:15:05.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.08,1:15:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓紧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.06,1:15:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,撑住 姑娘们 我来救你们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on, girls! I got you!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.05,1:15:20.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,撑不住了 我在往下滑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't. I'm slipping!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.04,1:15:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.05,1:15:25.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.01,1:15:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 露西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Lucy.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.05,1:15:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走 我们还没安全呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go! We're not safe yet!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.08,1:15:37.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,小黄人们 是时候做你们最擅长的了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Minions, time to do what we do best.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.01,1:15:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们为老大欢呼 我们为老大而战{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will cheer for our boss. We will fight for our boss.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.00,1:15:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来戳破这些泡泡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll pop the bubbles!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.00,1:15:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 坏蛋 - 坏蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Villain! - Villain!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.07,1:15:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们也是 你们也是坏蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys too! You guys are villains!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.07,1:16:02.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at what we have here.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.09,1:16:07.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 格鲁 我要把你烤焦了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, Gru. This is going to be a total burn.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.03,1:16:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 不 不不不不不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no. No! No, no, no, no…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.05,1:16:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可是个坏小子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been a bad boy!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.02,1:16:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁都别想动我兄弟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody messes with my brother!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.03,1:16:47.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 怎么回事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.02,1:17:02.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,德鲁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dru!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.06,1:17:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,坚持住 我来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on! I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.06,1:17:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你毁了一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've ruined everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.02,1:17:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 去死吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now, it's time to die.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.07,1:17:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么遗言吗 格鲁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any last words, Gru?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.06,1:17:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.02,1:17:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就送你两个字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got two words for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.05,1:17:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,斗舞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dance fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.00,1:17:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题 大金刚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it is alright, Donkey Kong.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.07,1:17:30.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定会好好享受的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to enjoy this.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.01,1:17:51.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.08,1:17:53.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,轮到我了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My turn.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.08,1:18:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,游戏结束{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Game over!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.00,1:18:25.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在找这个吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this what you're looking for?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.03,1:18:26.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.04,1:18:38.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No…!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.00,1:18:44.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,诅咒你 格鲁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Curse you, Gru!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.09,1:18:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,诅咒你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Curse you…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.07,1:18:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,比尔 过来 罗伯特 做好你的工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bill, over there! Robert, work your pick.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.04,1:18:51.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,查克 再用力点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chuck, more bashing!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.04,1:18:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,德鲁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dru.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.07,1:18:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,德鲁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dru.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.04,1:19:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们成功了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, we did it!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.00,1:19:10.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我们成功了 兄弟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, we did, brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.05,1:19:12.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 格鲁 - 格鲁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Gru! - Gru!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.08,1:19:14.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,姑娘们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Girls!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.07,1:19:28.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,格鲁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gru!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.08,1:19:31.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅尔 欢迎回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Mel. Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.00,1:20:05.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱你 妈妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Love you, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.02,1:20:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是妈妈啦 我是妈妈啦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a Mom. I'm a Mom!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.03,1:20:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,打他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hit it! Ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.06,1:20:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,骗子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cheater!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.01,1:20:28.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这个怎样 骗子 - 不 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How do you like this, Cheater? - No. No.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.04,1:20:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们 睡觉时间到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boys. Time for bed.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.08,1:20:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,明早还要去上班{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're back at work in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.00,1:20:37.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我来了 亲爱的 - 嗨 露西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm coming, sweetie. - Hi, Lucy.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.02,1:20:38.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,明见 兄弟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you tomorrow, brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.09,1:20:42.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经复职了 所以今晚别干坏事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I'm back on the job. So no villainy tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.02,1:20:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,懂了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh, got it?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.04,1:20:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不保证 爱你哟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I make no promises. Love you!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.06,1:20:48.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh-huh, right.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.07,1:20:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也爱你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you too.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.02,1:20:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 爱你们所有 去 去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright, every… Go. Go.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.00,1:20:56.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,去睡觉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to bed.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.07,1:21:02.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们 走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Guys. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.08,1:21:21.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么鬼东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the heck is happening?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.09,1:21:24.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像是外面传来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's coming from outside!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.08,1:21:29.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是说好了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I thought we said no more villainy!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.03,1:21:30.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 兄弟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.06,1:21:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,总得有人继承我们家族的光荣传统{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody's got to keep the family tradition alive.
