Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.01,1:21:38.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,坏蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Villain!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.06,1:21:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去抓他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get him.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.06,1:21:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 他是我兄弟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, he's my brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.01,1:21:51.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就让他5分钟把 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll give him a 5 minute head start.
